        "title": "Kandih khou puanmei tingkau guang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih khou puanmei tingkau guang dailiangmei,",
            "Bumang thanmei nun rui neilapui lu rui thuan e;",
            "Thauihian liangmei tikgun daidiu,",
            "Kandih mei nun khang njangmei sudiu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He tingkau bumang thanmei nun rui,",
            "Bethlehem dang thu kao bamme;",
            "Kaniu neila pui lu khuan rui,",
            "Immanuel guang daimei tikgun daidiu tu e.",
            "",
            "2. Chamloumei guang nthanmei 3)_ puan pat the,",
            "David kaikhuang ganchuanga tingsang gangai mei,",
            "Tingsangjang guang tu bam lana,",
            "Kajan thukmei tingsangjang thuan kuni.",
            "",
            "3. He bumang thanmei nun 3)_ rui suan datna,",
            "Bethlehem namdai khou ai bampui kan khou 3)_;",
            "Kaniu khuan le kaniu puan 3)_,",
            "Alung khou hei tingsangjang thuan kandiu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
